    "updated_at": "2020-02-13T17:28:33Z",
    "body": "In the spec, they are totally different event loops, so I'm not sure we really need to clarify that they're unrelated?\r\n\r\nIn general, I'm hesitant to add notes to the spec about things that the spec does *not* say; there's an infinite number of those...",
