    "updated_at": "2020-02-14T18:45:11Z",
    "body": "I hadn't seen that part of the spec and I do believe that it does adequately cover what I was referring to. You're right about the point of frame callbacks in a worker (as I understand it). I think it's reasonable to close this, but I defer to you and Simon.",
