    "body": "Oh, regarding the specific part of results having to be drawn into a canvas in the main thread, this isn't correct either - Canvas can transfer control to OffscreenCanvas, after which the OffscreenCanvas is fully in control of rendering (and if implemented correctly, can bypass the main thread entirely). This is this bug: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=202797 and documented in the spec here: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#dom-canvas-transfercontroltooffscreen",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
