    "updated_at": "2020-02-15T04:31:30Z",
    "body": ">  I think it's reasonable to close this, but I defer to you and Simon.\r\n\r\nYou opened it, so if you feel like the situation has been cleared-up, I think you can close it! Unless someone else feels like the issues hasn't been clarified. \r\n\r\nBy the way, nice WIP in Webkit. \r\n\r\nShameless plug follows: if you ever wanted to contribute to Servo, this stuff hasn't been implemented yet. We do have the `OffscreenCanvas` dom object, and it hasn't even been made transferable yet! Also, dedicated workers are not setup in any way yet to be part of a raf workflow. With your experience(I read some of the articles in your blog, interesting!) it might be an interesting project to take on! See https://github.com/servo/servo/issues/24277",
