    "body": "Even if a worker is able to get stuff onto the screen without main thread involvement, I'm still confused about why you wouldn't want rAF to fire at roughly the same time in a worker and on the main thread (assuming a responsive main thread). If both are painting, don't you want to be able to make sure they get related content to the screen at the same time?",
