    "updated_at": "2020-02-16T12:58:47Z",
    "body": "> Even if a worker is able to get stuff onto the screen without main thread involvement, I'm still confused about why you wouldn't want rAF to fire at roughly the same time in a worker and on the main thread (assuming a responsive main thread). If both are painting, don't you want to be able to make sure they get related content to the screen at the same time?\r\n\r\nCertainly you want both to be aligned with composition/screen refresh. Just it's not something that can be guaranteed - I think we're probably all on the same page at this point though, do you think there's anything that needs clarification in the spec?",
